#4471 merged every date report into one known issue. The reports are two causes. The table computes the split from the export. Intake tags are a guess from the browser. The cause comes from the tenant: the locale they write dates in, and the booking form they run.

`parser`. The shared parser reads every date month first. A day-first tenant's dates come out flipped.

`hint`. booking-v3 prints MM/DD/YYYY under the date field. People on that form type the month first, and the form reads the day first.

Desk notes name reports that were read as a one-day move. They stay in the cause their tenant gives them. The table footnotes those reports under that cause.

